- Assistant messages now render as markdown instead of raw text: GFM (tables, strikethrough, task lists) via `remark-gfm`, LaTeX via `remark-math` + `rehype-katex`, and mermaid diagrams via a dedicated `Mermaid` component that intercepts ` ```mermaid ` fences. User messages are unchanged (still plain text) and error messages are unchanged (still plain text, so their newlines keep rendering via the existing `white-space: pre-wrap`).
