- `mermaid.initialize` runs at `securityLevel: 'strict'` (sanitizes labels) since diagram source can carry LLM-generated or document-derived text; its render output is still injected via `dangerouslySetInnerHTML`, so this is what makes that safe rather than merely assumed safe.
